                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="borad_view">
                                <p>
                                    <h2 data-start="890" data-end="927"><img class="size-medium wp-image-227557 alignleft" src="https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ck-global-03-1-300x300.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="300" srcset="https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ck-global-03-1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ck-global-03-1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ck-global-03-1-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ck-global-03-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ck-global-03-1-440x440.jpg 440w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></h2>
<h2 data-start="890" data-end="927"> </h2>
<h2 data-start="890" data-end="927"> </h2>
<h2 data-start="89" data-end="115"> </h2>
<h2 data-start="89" data-end="115"> </h2>
<h2 data-start="89" data-end="115"> </h2>
<h2 data-start="89" data-end="115"> </h2>
<h2 data-start="89" data-end="115">2026학년도 외국인전형 추가모집 안내</h2>
<p><em><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.ck.ac.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260122_013655.pdf">2026 청강문화산업대학교 외국인 전형 추가모집 입시요강_international admission2</a></span></strong></em></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">◎ 원서접수기간 | Application Period</span></strong></p>
<ul data-start="205" data-end="291">
<li data-start="205" data-end="240">
<p data-start="207" data-end="240"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong data-start="207" data-end="238">2026. 1. 21.(수) ~ 2. 27.(금)</strong></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="241" data-end="291">
<p data-start="243" data-end="291"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">January 21 (Wed), 2026 – February 27 (Fri), 2026</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong data-start="371" data-end="393">◎ 자격요건 | Eligibility</strong></span></p>
<ul data-start="394" data-end="689">
<li data-start="394" data-end="424">
<p data-start="396" data-end="424"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">지원자 본인 및 부모 모두 외국 국적을 가진 자</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="425" data-end="458">
<p data-start="427" data-end="458"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">국내 또는 해외에서 고등학교 과정을 이수(졸업)한 자</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="459" data-end="502">
<p data-start="461" data-end="502"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">국내 외국인학교, 검정고시, 홈스쿨링, 사이버 학습 이수자는 지원 불가</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="504" data-end="564">
<p data-start="506" data-end="564"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Applicant and both parents must hold foreign nationality</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="565" data-end="612">
<p data-start="567" data-end="612"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">High school graduate (domestic or overseas)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="613" data-end="689">
<p data-start="615" data-end="689"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Not eligible: foreign schools in Korea, GED, homeschooling, cyber learning</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>모집전공 | Majors</span></h2>
<ul data-start="716" data-end="1091">
<li data-start="716" data-end="750">
<p data-start="718" data-end="750"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">융합콘텐츠창작 (Convergence Contents)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="751" data-end="772">
<p data-start="753" data-end="772"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">애니메이션 (Animation)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="773" data-end="810">
<p data-start="775" data-end="810"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">웹툰만화콘텐츠 (Webtoon Manhwa Contents)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="811" data-end="852">
<p data-start="813" data-end="852"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">만화캐릭터일러스트레이션 (Character Illustration)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="853" data-end="883">
<p data-start="855" data-end="883"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">웹소설창작 (Web Novel Creation)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="884" data-end="897">
<p data-start="886" data-end="897"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">게임 (Game)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="898" data-end="935">
<p data-start="900" data-end="935"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">패션·뷰티스타일 (Fashion &amp; Beauty Style)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="936" data-end="971">
<p data-start="938" data-end="971"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">연출·극작 (Directing &amp; Playwriting)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="972" data-end="998">
<p data-start="974" data-end="998"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">뮤지컬연기 (Musical Acting)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="999" data-end="1038">
<p data-start="1001" data-end="1038"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">연극·영상연기 (Theatre and Screen Acting)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1039" data-end="1062">
<p data-start="1041" data-end="1062"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">무대미술 (Stage Design)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1063" data-end="1091">
<p data-start="1065" data-end="1091"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">자율전공 (Self-Designed Major)</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>선발방법 | Selection Method</span></h3>
<ul data-start="1128" data-end="1176">
<li data-start="1128" data-end="1141">
<p data-start="1130" data-end="1141"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">서류평가 100%</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1142" data-end="1176">
<p data-start="1144" data-end="1176"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Document-Based Evaluation (100%)</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>제출서류 | Required Documents</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">1. 고등학교 졸업증명서 (</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">High School Graduation Certificate)</span></p>
<p data-start="1273" data-end="1285"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2. 고등학교 성적증명서 (</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">High School Academic Transcript)</span></p>
<p data-start="1326" data-end="1342"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">3. 지원자 및 부모 여권 사본 (</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Copies of Passports : Applicant and Both Parents)</span></p>
<p data-start="1400" data-end="1427"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">4. 본국에서 발행한 가족관계증명서에 해당하는 서류 (</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Family Relationship Certificate issued by the applicant’s home country or Birth certificate)</span></p>
<p data-start="1507" data-end="1514"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">5. 재정증명서 </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">본인 명의 은행 잔고증명서 (한화 2,000만 원 이상) (</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Bank Balance Certificate under the applicant’s name</span><br data-start="1608" data-end="1611" />
<span style="font-size: 12pt;">Minimum balance: KRW 20,000,000)</span></p>
<p data-start="1650" data-end="1757"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※ 모든 제출 서류는 아포스티유 또는 영사확인을 받아야 함</span><br data-start="1682" data-end="1685" />
<span style="font-size: 12pt;">※ All submitted documents must be apostilled or consularly authenticated</span></p>
<p data-start="1650" data-end="1757"> </p>
<h3><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>서류 제출처 | Submission of Documents</span></h3>
<ul data-start="1803" data-end="1867">
<li data-start="1803" data-end="1832">
<p data-start="1805" data-end="1832"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">이메일 제출: <strong data-start="1813" data-end="1830"><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener" data-start="1815" data-end="1828">gina@ck.ac.kr</a></strong></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1833" data-end="1867">
<p data-start="1835" data-end="1867"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Submit by email (PDF files only)</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p data-start="1869" data-end="1949"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※ 서류는 PDF 파일로 이메일 제출하며, 입학 확정 후 원본 서류 제출 필수</span><br data-start="1912" data-end="1915" />
<span style="font-size: 12pt;">※ 원본 서류 제출이 불가능한 경우 입학이 취소될 수 있음</span></p>
<p data-start="1869" data-end="1949"> </p>
<h3><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>서류 제출 기간 | Document Submission Period</span></h3>
<ul data-start="2000" data-end="2062">
<li data-start="2000" data-end="2017">
<p data-start="2002" data-end="2017"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">원서접수 이후 7일 이내</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2018" data-end="2062">
<p data-start="2020" data-end="2062"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Within 7 days after application submission</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="2069" data-end="2101"> </h3>
<h3 data-start="2069" data-end="2101"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>합격자 발표 | Admission Results</span></h3>
<ul data-start="2102" data-end="2178">
<li style="list-style-type: none;" data-start="2102" data-end="2129">
<ol start="2026" data-start="2104" data-end="2129">
<li style="list-style-type: none;" data-start="2104" data-end="2129">
<ol start="2" data-start="2110" data-end="2129">
<li data-start="2110" data-end="2129">
<p data-start="2113" data-end="2129"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2.(월) 이후 개별 통지</span></p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li data-start="2130" data-end="2178">
<p data-start="2132" data-end="2178"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Individual notification after February 2, 2026</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="2185" data-end="2222"> </h3>
<h3 data-start="2185" data-end="2222"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>등록금 납부 | Tuition Payment Period</span></h3>
<ul data-start="2223" data-end="2286">
<li data-start="2223" data-end="2241">
<p data-start="2225" data-end="2241"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">합격 통지 이후 3일 이내</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2242" data-end="2286">
<p data-start="2244" data-end="2286"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Within 3 days after admission notification</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="2293" data-end="2336"> </h3>
<h3 data-start="2293" data-end="2336"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>표준입학허가서 발급 | Certificate of Admission</span></h3>
<ul data-start="2337" data-end="2402">
<li data-start="2337" data-end="2355">
<p data-start="2339" data-end="2355"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">등록금 납부 확인 후 발급</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2356" data-end="2402">
<p data-start="2358" data-end="2402"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Issued after confirmation of tuition payment</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3> </h3>
<h3><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>오리엔테이션 | Orientation</span></h3>
<ul data-start="2436" data-end="2486">
<li data-start="2436" data-end="2457">
<p data-start="2438" data-end="2457"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2026년 2월 중순 (온라인)</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2458" data-end="2486">
<p data-start="2460" data-end="2486"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Mid-February 2026 (Online)</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3> </h3>
<h3><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>◎ </strong>입학식 | Entrance Ceremony</span></h3>
<ul>
<li data-start="2534" data-end="2541"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2026.3.3.(화)</span></li>
<li data-start="2542" data-end="2563">
<p data-start="2544" data-end="2563"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">March 3, 2026 (Tue)</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※ 상기 일정은 학교 사정에 따라 변경될 수 있습니다.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p data-start="2570" data-end="2673"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※ The above schedule is subject to change due to school circumstances.</span></p>
